# DRAGON loads with DragonRules, links every tag, NewGame runs table_control_handler, a ball is launched.
# Expected values are literals from the port listing (table_control_handler NewGame case): ball save 3,
# jackpot 1,000,000, super jackpot 2,500,000. The mode is 10: NewGame (Mode10LaunchBallController) starts in mode 10
# with the ball on the plunger; Wine's first sample after NewGame is mode 10 too.
init window 960 666
init fixed_dt 10
init seed 1
10 key down new_game
11 key up new_game
30 expect ball_save == 3
30 expect mode == 10
30 expect jackpot == 1000000
30 expect super_jackpot == 2500000
200 key down plunger
300 key up plunger
800 dump after_launch
800 quit
